    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(2) For the purposes of subsection (1), conduct is of public benefit if, and only if, the conduct is necessary for or of assistance in:  (a) enforcing a law of the Commonwealth, a State or Territory, or a foreign country; or  (b) monitoring compliance with, or investigating a contravention of, a law of the Commonwealth, a State or Territory or a foreign country; or  (c) the administration of justice (whether within or outside Australia);";
