    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A person is not criminally responsible for an offence against section 471.19 or 471.20 if the conduct is of public benefit and does not extend beyond what is of public benefit.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>;
