<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-471-6-ss-1-logic-deontic-5> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
